You have two possible solution to control the number of the hits. The first solution is to use the widget [`HitsPerPageSelector` ](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/hitsPerPageSelector.html)it will display a select that lets the user control how many hits are displayed. But in case you don't want to let the user choose you can use the [`Configure`](https://community.algolia.com/instantsearch.js/v2/widgets/configure.html) widget. 

```jsx
search.addWidget(
  instantsearch.widgets.configure({
    hitsPerPage: 8,
  })
);
```
